You're going almost weirdly the reverse.

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:55.040
What's the first jump in the pool,

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:56.604
first three weeks kinda feeling?

00:18:56.604 --> 00:18:58.101
Tell the truth.

00:18:58.101 --> 00:19:00.604
- It's a little different.

00:19:00.604 --> 00:19:01.606
- No it's important. It's important.

00:19:01.606 --> 00:19:02.439
- It's a little different.
- 'Cause I won't let

00:19:02.439 --> 00:19:03.608
Eytan fire you.

00:19:03.608 --> 00:19:04.610
(laughs)

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:05.443
- And I want to bring value for everybody

00:19:05.443 --> 00:19:06.276
