00:19:06.276 --> 00:19:08.220
- It's different because there's a checks

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:09.540
and balances system now, right.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.600
So you know learning to work--

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.110
- Right, when you screwed up before,

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.650
you could make pretend
there wasn't a screw up.

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:16.707
- [Dylan] Right.

00:19:16.707 --> 00:19:17.700
- And just get away with
it in a family business.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:18.711
- [Dylan] Yeah.

00:19:18.711 --> 00:19:19.711
- But with this you can't do that.

00:19:19.711 --> 00:19:20.711
- [Dylan] You can't.

00:19:20.711 --> 00:19:21.712
- Yeah.

00:19:21.712 --> 00:19:22.712
- [Dylan] Not at all.

00:19:22.712 --> 00:19:23.712
- No but that's true right?

00:19:23.712 --> 00:19:24.714
- Yeah, yeah it is true.

00:19:24.714 --> 00:19:25.715
You know, you can kinda hide
behind the curtain when you're

00:19:25.715 --> 00:19:26.548
