- And I'll tell it as a kid

00:19:26.548 --> 00:19:27.776
who was in a family business
that had carte blanche.

00:19:27.776 --> 00:19:30.416
I would always yell at my dad back

00:19:30.416 --> 00:19:34.670
not about the micro loss,
which I had plenty of.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.230
It was the macro win.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:38.130
Anytime he'd be like, that, I didn't.

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:40.220
Why did we spend $4,000 on those coupons?

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:41.053
We didn't get anything.

00:19:41.053 --> 00:19:43.050
I'm like, Dad, at the end of the year,

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:45.670
you are more than welcome to
kick me out of this place.

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:49.890
But let's look at it as a
whole not this week in May.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:50.760
And the truth is, and I want

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:51.593
to give him a whole lot of credit.

00:19:51.593 --> 00:19:52.860
He didn't have a whole lot of that energy.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.979
It more of just the look
of like, you know like,

00:19:54.979 --> 00:19:57.130
why did we waste money? (laughs)

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.850
You would have that in a family business.

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:01.380
Here, you've got a new boss.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.520
You've gotta prove yourself, right?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.350
- Mmm-hmm, 100%.

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.950
- And what are you most excited about

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.596
in the first three weeks?

00:20:07.596 --> 00:20:09.530
- I think just being immersed

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:11.614
in a totally different type of culture.

00:20:11.614 --> 00:20:13.613
New York city, you know.
- Sure, the speed.

00:20:13.613 --> 00:20:18.455
- The speed, being around people who have,

00:20:18.455 --> 00:20:23.282
a lifestyle that's kinda
like more than where I'm from

00:20:23.282 --> 00:20:24.282
I guess you would say.
- Sure.

00:20:24.282 --> 00:20:25.534
You mean the fellow employees

00:20:25.534 --> 00:20:27.413
