00:44:40.470 --> 00:44:41.303
I don't have VC's.

00:44:41.303 --> 00:44:42.670
I don't have credit.

00:44:42.670 --> 00:44:44.340
I'm doing it because I'm reinvesting.

00:44:44.340 --> 00:44:45.700
- [Steve] Absolutely.

00:44:45.700 --> 00:44:46.760
